e and fractional values.\n- Implement mean_values(a, b) in src/helper.py and import/use it in src/main.py.\n- Write tests/test_compute.py with a unittest checking compute(2, 3) == 2.5.\n- All three files (src/main.py, src/helper.py, tests/test_compute.py) are required.\n- Validate with the public behavioral check (checks/public_check.py) and build via Python bytecode compilation of src."}, "output_paths_kind": "read_only_capture_evidence", "business_path": null, "workspace": "/Users/ayang/Desktop/project_work/Chimera/docs/dataset-evaluation/reports/stage2/full-from-scratch-20261015/q2-q3/failure-rerun-20261016/tasks/q2-t0413/study/workspaces/retry-q2-t0413-t0001", "execution_environment": {"cwd": "/Users/ayang/Desktop/project_work/Chimera/docs/dataset-evaluation/reports/stage2/full-from-scratch-20261015/q2-q3/failure-rerun-20261016/tasks/q2-t0413/study/workspaces/retry-q2-t0413-t0001", "python_executable": "/opt/anaconda3/bin/python", "default_build_command": "/opt/anaconda3/bin/python -m compileall -q src", "build_kind": "python_bytecode_compilation", "optional_modules": {"pytest": true, "build": false, "pip": true, "setuptools": true}}}, "status": "success", "schema_version": "chimera-event/1", "event_seq": 5, "event_id": "124e0f26072049afa16d656451d1275c", "wall_time_utc": "2026-10-16T07:52:01.075861+00:00", "simulation_clock_kind": "task_start_plus_logical_order"}
